### The logged-in user's Duties, by Index (logicx-front's Duties list), each with its SOP's Frequency,
	# the first day of its current calendar period (a Daily Duty's is today) as "date", and the Job
	# Summary counts of its Duty Reporting in that period (0 without one).
	# {"employee": null} when no Employee is linked.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/logicx_biz.logicx_hr.duty_view.get_duty_list
