### The Duty's Duty Reporting in its current calendar period, made now, dated the period's first day,
	# when there is none (logicx-front's Duty Reporting page). POST only, as it may write. Its
	# "activity", "execution" and "others" are as enquiry_view.get_enquiry has them. 404 for a Duty
	# that isn't the logged-in user's own Employee's.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/logicx_biz.logicx_hr.duty_view.get_duty_reporting
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Duty12"
}

